# SVG assets

Never convert SVG files into any other file type (PNG, JPG, WebP, PDF, etc.) without explicit user permission.

- Keep SVGs as SVGs in the repo and in the site.
- If another format seems necessary, ask first and wait for approval before converting.
- Prefer native SVG exports from Figma over rasterized or recreated substitutes when the user provides them.
